'''Kalinga's at-large congressional district''' is the sole [[congressional district of the Philippines]] for the province of [[Kalinga (province)|Kalinga]]. It is currently represented in the [[20th Congress of the Philippines|20th Congress]] by [[Caroline Agyao]] of [[Partido Federal ng Pilipinas]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=House Members - 20th Congress |url=https://www.congress.gov.ph/house-members |access-date=2026-07-14 |website=[[House of Representatives of the Philippines]]}}</ref>

